 unicorn’s innate spellcasting ability is Charisma (spell save DC 14). The unicorn can innately cast the following spells, requiring no components:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"At will:"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"detect evil and good"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"druidcraft"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"pass without trace"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"1/day each:"},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"calm emotions"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"dispel evil and good"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":","},{"element":"a","class":"tooltip-hover spell-tooltip","text":"entangle"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Magic Resistance."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn has advantage on saving throws against spells and other magical effects."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Magic Weapons."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn’s weapon attacks are magical."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Actions"},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Multiattack."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn makes two attacks: one with its hooves and one with its horn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Hooves."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+7"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 5 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"11"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d6 + 4)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"bludgeoning damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Horn."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Melee Weapon Attack:"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"+7"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"to hit, reach 5 ft., one target."},{"element":"em","class":"","text":"Hit:"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"8"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(1d8 + 4)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"piercing damage."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Healing Touch (3/Day)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn touches another creature with its horn. The target magically regains 11"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d8 + 2)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"hit points. In addition, the touch removes all diseases and neutralizes all poisons afflicting the target."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Teleport (1/Day)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn magically teleports itself and up to three willing creatures it can see within 5 feet of it, along with any equipment they are wearing or carrying, to a location the unicorn is familiar with, up to 1 mile away."},{"element":"div","class":"mon-stat-block__description-block-heading","text":"Legendary Actions"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn can take 3 legendary actions, choosing from the options below. Only one legendary action option can be used at a time and only at the end of another creature’s turn. The unicorn regains spent legendary actions at the start of its turn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Hooves."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn makes one attack with its hooves."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Shimmering Shield (Costs 2 Actions)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn creates a shimmering, magical field around itself or another creature it can see within 60 feet of it. The target gains a +2 bonus to AC until the end of the unicorn’s next turn."},{"element":"strong","class":"","text":"Heal Self (Costs 3 Actions)."},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"The unicorn magically regains 11"},{"element":"span","class":"","text":"(2d8 + 2)"},{"element":"p","class":"","text":"hit points."}],"tags":146,"max_dom_depth":7}